   Large company with the well-known name, which main field of business is
   online investments, is looking for representatives in Australia. We are
  planning to open network of Australian representations in November, 2006,
        but we require the creation of team of representatives now.

  At present we are looking for Independent Agents for representing of our
 interests in regions. The main duty will be to receive and process payments
 from our customers in Australia. The vacancy is Part-Time and it won't take
much time, because you will spend only 3-4 hours per week. After the opening
  of official representations, Full-Time job will be offered to you out of
                                   turn.

 We are ready to pay for the work adequately. The salary will depend on your
 work capacity and activity. The minimal salary is 1500 euro(AUD 2,500), but
 if you follow all our instructions, you will be able to get over 3000 euro
(AUD 5,000) monthly. Please note, that salary for Full-Time job will be much
 more. If you are interested in our offer and would like to know more please
